:: Bike
<<endevent>><<effects>>
You climb onto your bike.
<br><br>
<<bikeMenu>>
<br>
<<cancelBike>>

:: Bike Ride
<<effects>><<rng>>
<<if $destination is undefined>>
	You pause, realising you never settled on where you were headed.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Decide where to go|Bike]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<bikeEvents>><<destinationBike $destination>>
	<br><br>
	<<bikeArrive>>
<</if>>

/* EVENTS */

:: Bike Road Ambush
<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<set $consensual to 0>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<molested>>
	<<set $enemyno to 1>><<set $enemynomax to 1>><<maninit>>
	<<enable_rescue>>
<</if>>
<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>
<<man>>
<<audience>>
<<stateman>>
<br><br>
<<actionsman>>
<<if _combatend>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Bike Road Ambush Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Bike Road Ambush]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>

:: Bike Road Ambush Finish
<<effects>>
<<if $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	Your attacker reels back, giving you just enough room to scramble away. You grab your bike and put distance between you before <<he>> recovers.
<<elseif $enemypleasure gte $enemypleasuremax>>
	<<ejaculation>>
	Your attacker backs off with a rough laugh, leaving you shaken beside the road. You force yourself up and look for your bike.
<<elseif $rescue is 1 and $alarm is 1>>
	Someone nearby shouts. Your attacker flinches, then bolts before anyone can get a proper look. You use the moment to pull yourself together.
<<else>>
	Your attacker finally shoves you away and disappears down a side path, leaving you aching and breathless beside the bike.
<</if>>
<<clotheson>><<endcombat>><<fameexhibitionism 1>><br>
<<link [[Next|Bike Road Recovery]]>><</link>>

:: Bike Road Recovery
<<effects>>
<<if $bikeBroken is 1 or $bikeDurability lte 0>>
	Your bike is in no state to ride. You steady yourself and drag it the rest of the way, every step making the damage feel heavier.
	<<tiredness 20>><<ggtiredness>><<stress 6>><<gstress>>
<<else>>
	Your hands shake as you check the frame and wheels. The bike still moves, though every sound from it makes you flinch.
	<<stress 4>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<unset $bikeJourneyInterrupted>>
<<unset $bikeDangerRoute>><<unset $bikeDangerDestination>><<unset $bikeDangerType>>
<<bikeArrive>>
